:: day2_hub_futa [nobr]
<!--
  PLACEHOLDER   pipeline test only, AND the current end of the
  public build's content (futa route).
  Day 0 and Day 1 are both real, playable content as of v0.3, so
  the futa route flows straight through them without any "end of
  build" interruption   the notice only fires here, once the player
  actually runs out of written content. Uses its own
  <<endOfContentNoticeFuta>> widget (widgets.tw), matching the
  female route's <<endOfContentNoticeFemale>> at day2_hub.tw.
  Replace with real Day 2 ("Both, Still") content and its own
  day2ftInit flag block (mirroring day1ft-init.tw) when written   at
  that point, move the <<endOfContentNoticeFuta>> call below down to
  wherever the new content's own final passage ends.
-->
<div class="day-transition">
  <h2><<print formatDayNumber($dayNumber)>>   Both, Still</h2>
  <p>(Day 2 content not yet written. Days -2 through Day 1 are
  fully playable end to end on the futanari route   the Rite, the
  first day of recovery in the Moonspire Tower, and everything
  before it.)</p>
  <p><<print $mcName>>, <<print $mcTitle>>. Height <<print $mcHeight>>,
  bust <<print $mcBust>>. Stress: <<print $stress>> | Energy: <<print $energy>> | Arousal: <<print $arousal>></p>
</div>

<<endOfContentNoticeFuta>>
